  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "R.Govindaraj vs The Commissioner on 4 April, 2024 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan 1 W.P.(Md)No.8568 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 04.04.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan W.P.(MD)No.8568 of 2024 And W.M.P.(MD)No.7799 of 2024 R.Govindaraj ... Petition Vs. 1. The Commissioner, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration, Dms Campus, 5th Floor No.359, Anna Salai, Teynampet, Chennai 6. 2 . The Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Food Safety Wing, Trichy District. ... Respond Prayer: Writ petition filed under Article 226 of the C of India, to issue a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, to call for t records pertaining to the impugned order passed by the 2nd responde his proceedings Na.Ka.No.2508/U.Paa.Trichy/2023 dated 24.01.2024 and quash the same as illegal and consequently directing the 2nd respondent to de-seal the petitioner's shop namely Balaji Store sit 4/214, Nochiyam, Trichy to Salem Road, Manachanallur Taluk, Trichy District. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/4 2 W.P.(MD)NO.8568 For Petitioner : Mr.T.Leninkumar For Respondents : Mr.D.Sasikumar, Additional Government Pleader. R.Govindaraj vs The Commissioner on 4 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/89748242/ 1 * ** ORDER Heard both sides. 2. The petitioner is running a petty shop which was sealed by the second respondent on 24.01.2024. The petitioner has been charged with vending banned tobacco products. Since the shop has been kept under lock and seal for more than 30 days, I am inclined to grant relief.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": ""
  },
